1. AI Search
Vanilla’s AI Search Assistant provides conversational answers based on community discussions and knowledge articles, with source citations for verification.

Benefit type	Business benefits
Qualitative	Improve customer experience by making technical answers easier to find through natural-language questions.
Qualitative	Improve access to existing community knowledge by summarizing relevant information and linking to supporting sources.
Qualitative	Allow support engineers and subject-matter experts to focus on complex issues rather than repeatedly answering common questions.
Quantitative	Reduce average time required to find a correct technical answer.
Quantitative	Increase the percentage of customer questions resolved through self-service.
Quantitative	Reduce repetitive support tickets and associated support-handling effort.
Suggested evaluation measures
Time to answer: Compare average task-completion time with current search versus AI Search using the same representative technical questions.

Successful self-service rate: Measure the percentage of evaluated questions correctly resolved without human assistance.

Support effort avoided: Estimate incremental tickets avoided × average handling time × loaded support labor rate.

Do not count every AI interaction as an avoided ticket; count only cases where evidence indicates the user would otherwise have contacted support.

2. AI Translations
Vanilla translates supported discussions, comments, and knowledge articles into configured languages, while retaining access to the original text. Custom terms help maintain consistent product and community terminology.

Benefit type	Business benefits
Qualitative	Improve access to technical knowledge for customers who prefer languages other than the source language.
Qualitative	Enable knowledge sharing across regions and reduce language barriers to community participation.
Qualitative	Improve consistency of product terminology through configured custom translations.
Quantitative	Reduce manual translation and review effort for eligible community content.
Quantitative	Reduce turnaround time to make new or updated content available in supported languages.
Quantitative	Increase multilingual content coverage and engagement among target-lang
